{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e08-scene-21",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "同步电脑里的认可  (Synced Files and Quiet Approval)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After sending over the meeting minutes, Bu Xiaogu visits Chun Yuqiao's office to put in a kind word for Lin Jie—and discovers how her overhaul plan mysteriously landed on the conference-room laptop. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，方案会的会议记录我已经发您邮箱了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您还生气吗？就是昨天演播室那个蛋糕什么的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "生什么气啊？我已经忘了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实林姐她们对你是一片真心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不管她们嘴上说什么，她们心里绝对是信任你、佩服你的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "改版方案上会前您根本就没看过，就直接推上去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你真的对我做的方案认可吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我看过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么时候？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总编室配给你的电脑是之前我用过的，上面都是我的账户。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的文件我都同步看，包括你上网浏览的每一张图片。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以会上桌面上的保守方案，是你改成的改版方案？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还有什么要问的吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，方案会的会议记录我已经发您邮箱了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, I have already emailed you the minutes from the proposal meeting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您还生气吗？就是昨天演播室那个蛋糕什么的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you still angry—about that cake in the studio yesterday?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "生什么气啊？我已经忘了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Angry about what? I have forgotten it already.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实林姐她们对你是一片真心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Truthfully, Lin Jie and her team mean well toward you from the heart.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不管她们嘴上说什么，她们心里绝对是信任你、佩服你的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whatever they say aloud, deep down they truly trust and admire you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is there anything else?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "改版方案上会前您根本就没看过，就直接推上去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You pushed my overhaul plan straight into the meeting without even reading it beforehand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你真的对我做的方案认可吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you genuinely approve of the proposal I wrote?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我看过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I read it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么时候？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总编室配给你的电脑是之前我用过的，上面都是我的账户。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The computer assigned to you in the editorial office used to be mine and still has my account.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的文件我都同步看，包括你上网浏览的每一张图片。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every file of yours syncs to me—including every single picture you browse online.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以会上桌面上的保守方案，是你改成的改版方案？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So the conservative plan on the meeting desktop was swapped for the overhaul plan by you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还有什么要问的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have any more questions?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，方案会的会议记录我已经发您邮箱了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您还生气吗？就是昨天演播室那个蛋糕什么的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "生什么气啊？我已经忘了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实林姐她们对你是一片真心。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不管她们嘴上说什么，她们心里绝对是信任你、佩服你的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "改版方案上会前您根本就没看过，就直接推上去了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你真的对我做的方案认可吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我看过。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么时候？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总编室配给你的电脑是之前我用过的，上面都是我的账户。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的文件我都同步看，包括你上网浏览的每一张图片。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以会上桌面上的保守方案，是你改成的改版方案？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还有什么要问的吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Thrilled that Chun Yuqiao genuinely admired her draft—and mortified about her browser history—Bu Xiaogu hurries out with a grin. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
